  "plan": [
    "Change now: gift with purchase over $60: Sample sachet 10g. Base case $119.35 margin over 90 days (low $14.30, high $224.40); it breaks even when 13.0% of near-miss shoppers top up.",
    "Test: raise free shipping in the United States zone from $40 to $60. Base case $131.63 margin over 90 days (low -$607.53, high $713.58); it breaks even when 14.9% of near-miss shoppers top up. 146 orders sat between $40 and $60 and would lose free shipping, so test it before you switch.",
    "Show small add-ons in the cart while it is under the $40 free-shipping line: of the 76 near-miss orders, 26 were no more than $6 short (Honey sticks, 10 pack), 38 were no more than $9 short (Steel tea infuser), 62 were no more than $12 short (Chamomile tin 50g).",
    "Add a $35 minimum to WELCOME15: 57 of its orders (64.0%) were below it, with $165.00 of discount.",
    "Earl Grey tin 50g is bought alone in 49.8% of its orders: offer Earl Grey refill pouch 250g ($32) on its page and in the cart.",
    "Make one change at a time. Each lever above is modelled alone, and two changes launched together can't be told apart in the results."
  ],
